,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-06-10T23:06:24Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T16:16:29Z","closed_at":"2025-11-25T16:14:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproduceable in 4.5 dev build.\n\n### System information\nBoth Godot** v4.5.dev5.mono and Godot** v4.4.stable.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7640) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen writing a compositor effect, when you retrieve the camera projection matrix via: ```render_data.get_render_scene_data().get_cam_projection().get_z_far()```\nThe Z near distance is returned instead of far.\nI am not sure how this impacts actual usage of the projection matrix in the effects but I need the far clipping plane to improve my clouds.\n\nnote: I did test with just a normal camera3D and the projection matrix you get from that has the correct result when getting the Z far distance the same way, so it must be a scene data issue.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new compositor effect.\n- Retrieve Render Scene Data using `get_render_scene_data()`\n- Retrieve the Projection matrix using `get_cam_projection()`\n- Attempt to retrieve Z far distance using `get_z_far()`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[compositorzfarbug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20681100/compositorzfarbug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Rudolph-B","id":52322745,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIyNzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52322745?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B","html_url":"https://github.com/Rudolph-B","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107383/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107383/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}